<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fa" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
    <title>CYBER ARCADIA | آرکید فوق‌پیشرفته نئونی</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 64 64'><defs><linearGradient id='g' x1='0' y1='0' x2='1' y2='1'><stop offset='0' stop-color='%2300f3ff'/><stop offset='.5' stop-color='%23b000ff'/><stop offset='1' stop-color='%23ff0055'/></linearGradient></defs><rect x='3' y='3' width='58' height='58' rx='14' fill='%23020205' stroke='url(%23g)' stroke-width='4'/><path d='M18 24h28a8 8 0 0 1 8 8v6a6 6 0 0 1-10 4l-4-4H24l-4 4a6 6 0 0 1-10-4v-6a8 8 0 0 1 8-8z' fill='none' stroke='url(%23g)' stroke-width='3' stroke-linejoin='round'/><path d='M22 28v8M18 32h8' stroke='%2300f3ff' stroke-width='3' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='42' cy='30' r='2.5' fill='%23ff0055'/><circle cx='47' cy='35' r='2.5' fill='%2300f3ff'/></svg>">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#020205">
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Font Awesome icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@600;800;900&family=Vazirmatn:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        cyber: {
                            black: '#020205',
                            dark: '#080814',
                            card: 'rgba(12, 12, 28, 0.75)',
                            cyan: '#00f3ff',
                            magenta: '#ff0055',
                            purple: '#b000ff',
                            lime: '#00ff66',
                            yellow: '#ffcc00'
                        }
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        vazir: ['Vazirmatn', 'sans-serif'],
                        orbitron: ['Orbitron', 'sans-serif']
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>

    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #020205;
            color: #e2e8f0;
            font-family: 'Vazirmatn', sans-serif;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            user-select: none;
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
            touch-action: manipulation;
        }

        #bgCanvas {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100vw;
            height: 100vh;
            z-index: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .glow-text-cyan { text-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.9), 0 0 24px rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.5); }
        .glow-text-magenta { text-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(255, 0, 85, 0.9), 0 0 24px rgba(255, 0, 85, 0.5); }

        .glass-box {
            background: rgba(12, 12, 28, 0.75);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.2);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), inset 0 0 15px rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.05);
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }

        .glass-box:hover {
            border-color: rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.8);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.35), inset 0 0 20px rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.2);
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .cyber-btn {
            position: relative;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.2), rgba(176, 0, 255, 0.2));
            border: 1px solid #00f3ff;
            color: #00f3ff;
            font-weight: bold;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .cyber-btn:hover, .cyber-btn:active {
            background: #00f3ff;
            color: #020205;
            box-shadow: 0 0 25px #00f3ff;
        }

        .scanline {
            background: linear-gradient(
                to bottom,
                rgba(255,255,255,0),
                rgba(255,255,255,0) 50%,
                rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35) 50%,
                rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35)
            );
            background-size: 100% 4px;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        #gameCanvas {
            touch-action: none;
            cursor: crosshair;
        }

        /* 3D Memory Card Flip Effect */
        .card-inner {
            transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
            transform-style: preserve-3d;
        }
        .card-inner.flipped {
            transform: rotateY(180deg);
        }
        .card-front, .card-back {
            backface-visibility: hidden;
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
        }
        .card-back {
            transform: rotateY(180deg);
        }

        .perspective-1000 { perspective: 1000px; }
        #gameCanvas { max-width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; }
        #driveTouchControls { width: min(100%, 430px); direction: ltr; }
        #driveTouchControls button {
            min-height: 48px; border: 1px solid rgba(0,243,255,.42);
            border-radius: 14px; color: #dffcff; font-weight: 900;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(0,243,255,.16),rgba(176,0,255,.12));
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 14px rgba(0,243,255,.08), 0 4px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.3);
            touch-action: none; user-select: none; -webkit-user-select: none;
        }
        #driveTouchControls button:active, #driveTouchControls button.pressed {
            color: #020205; background: #00f3ff; box-shadow: 0 0 22px rgba(0,243,255,.55);
            transform: translateY(1px);
        }
        #driveTouchControls .nitro-control { border-color: rgba(255,0,85,.65); background: linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(255,0,85,.22),rgba(255,204,0,.12)); }
        #driveTouchControls .nitro-control:active, #driveTouchControls .nitro-control.pressed { background:#ff315a; color:white; }
        @media (max-height: 760px) {
            #canvasContainer { min-height: 0 !important; padding-top: 6px !important; padding-bottom: 6px !important; }
            #gameCanvas { max-height: 48vh; width: auto; }
            #driveTouchControls button { min-height: 42px; }
        }

        /* ---------- Intro splash ---------- */
        body.splash-lock { overflow: hidden !important; }
        #splash {
            position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 100;
            background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, #0c0c28 0%, #020205 70%);
            display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            transition: transform 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.77, 0, 0.18, 1);
            cursor: pointer; overflow: hidden; padding: 0 16px;
        }
        #splash.exit { transform: translateY(-100%); }
        #splash .splash-grid {
            position: absolute; inset: 0;
            background-image:
                linear-gradient(rgba(0,243,255,.09) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,243,255,.09) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 40px 40px;
            -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, #000 15%, transparent 72%);
            mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, #000 15%, transparent 72%);
            animation: splashGrid 4s linear infinite;
        }
        @keyframes splashGrid { to { background-position: 0 40px, 40px 0; } }
        .splash-line {
            display: flex; direction: ltr; position: relative;
            font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.1;
        }
        .splash-line span {
            opacity: 0; transform: translateY(34px) scale(.5); filter: blur(10px);
            animation: splashLetter .6s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1.3) forwards;
        }
        @keyframes splashLetter { to { opacity: 1; transform: none; filter: blur(0); } }
        .splash-cyber { font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 14vw, 5.5rem); letter-spacing: .1em; color: #00f3ff;
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,243,255,.9), 0 0 30px rgba(0,243,255,.6), 0 0 60px rgba(0,243,255,.35);
            animation: splashPulseC 2.2s ease-in-out 1.4s infinite; }
        .splash-arcadia { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 8.6vw, 3.4rem); letter-spacing: .32em; color: #ff0055; margin-top: .15em;
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255,0,85,.9), 0 0 30px rgba(255,0,85,.6), 0 0 60px rgba(255,0,85,.35);
            animation: splashPulseM 2.2s ease-in-out 1.6s infinite; }
        @keyframes splashPulseC { 50% { text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(0,243,255,.7), 0 0 18px rgba(0,243,255,.4); } }
        @keyframes splashPulseM { 50% { text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(255,0,85,.7), 0 0 18px rgba(255,0,85,.4); } }
        .splash-sub { margin-top: 1.4rem; font-size: .8rem; color: #94a3b8; opacity: 0; animation: splashFade .8s ease 1.5s forwards; text-align: center; }
        @keyframes splashFade { to { opacity: 1; } }
        .splash-bar { margin-top: 1.6rem; width: min(260px, 70vw); height: 3px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.1); border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; position: relative; }
        .splash-bar i { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 0; border-radius: 4px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #00f3ff, #b000ff, #ff0055); box-shadow: 0 0 12px #00f3ff;
            animation: splashLoad 2.6s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1) .2s forwards; }
        @keyframes splashLoad { to { width: 100%; } }
        .splash-hint { margin-top: .9rem; font-size: .65rem; color: #64748b; opacity: 0; animation: splashFade .8s ease 2s forwards; }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #020205; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #00f3ff; border-radius: 4px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="relative min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between overflow-x-hidden splash-lock">
    <!-- Intro splash: shows the site name, then slides up -->
    <div id="splash" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="splash-grid"></div>
        <div class="splash-line splash-cyber"><span style="animation-delay:0.15s">C</span><span style="animation-delay:0.24s">Y</span><span style="animation-delay:0.33s">B</span><span style="animation-delay:0.42s">E</span><span style="animation-delay:0.51s">R</span></div>
        <div class="splash-line splash-arcadia"><span style="animation-delay:0.70s">A</span><span style="animation-delay:0.79s">R</span><span style="animation-delay:0.88s">C</span><span style="animation-delay:0.97s">A</span><span style="animation-delay:1.06s">D</span><span style="animation-delay:1.15s">I</span><span style="animation-delay:1.24s">A</span></div>
        <p class="splash-sub">هاب آنلاین بازی‌های نئونی نسل جدید</p>
        <div class="splash-bar"><i></i></div>
        <p class="splash-hint">برای ورود لمس کنید</p>
    </div>


    <!-- Interactive Background Canvas -->
    <canvas id="bgCanvas"></canvas>
    
    <!-- CRT Scanline effect overlay -->
    <div class="fixed inset-0 scanline z-10 pointer-events-none opacity-30"></div>

    <div class="relative z-20 flex flex-col min-h-screen">

        <!-- HEADER / NAVIGATION -->
        <header class="w-full px-6 py-4 border-b border-cyan-500/20 bg-cyber-dark/80 backdrop-blur-md sticky top-0 z-50">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-between">
                
                <!-- Logo -->
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer" onclick="window.scrollTo({top:0, behavior:'smooth'})">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-tr from-cyber-cyan via-cyber-purple to-cyber-magenta p-[2px]">
                        <div class="w-full h-full bg-cyber-black rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-gamepad text-cyber-cyan text-xl"></i>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h1 class="text-2xl font-black tracking-widest font-orbitron text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyber-cyan via-white to-cyber-magenta">
                            CYBER<span class="text-cyber-cyan">ARCADIA</span>
                        </h1>
                        <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-400">هاب آنلاین بازی‌های نئونی نسل جدید</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Navigation Stats & Audio Toggle -->
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                    <div class="hidden sm:flex items-center gap-4 text-xs font-mono bg-cyber-dark px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-cyan-500/30">
                        <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-cyber-cyan">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-trophy text-yellow-400"></i> مجموع امتیازات: <span id="totalScoreDisplay" class="font-bold font-orbitron text-white">0</span>
                        </span>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Music Switcher -->
                    <button id="musicToggle" onclick="toggleMusic()" class="cyber-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i id="musicIcon" class="fa-solid fa-music text-cyber-cyan"></i>
                        <span id="musicText" class="hidden sm:inline">موسیقی: روشن</span>
                    </button>

                    <!-- SFX Switcher -->
                    <button id="soundToggle" onclick="toggleAudio()" class="cyber-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i id="soundIcon" class="fa-solid fa-volume-high text-cyber-cyan"></i>
                        <span id="soundText" class="hidden sm:inline">افکت: روشن</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <section class="relative pt-8 pb-4 px-6 text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
            <div class="inline-block px-4 py-1 mb-3 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/40 text-cyber-cyan text-xs font-semibold">
                ⚡ گرافیک نئونی ارتقایافته + بازی‌های آرکیدی با کنترل لمسی روان
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black mb-3 leading-tight glow-text-cyan">
                آرکید گیمینگ <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyber-cyan via-cyber-purple to-cyber-magenta">فوق‌پیشرفته سایبر</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs md:text-sm max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
                کنترل‌های بهینه‌شده لمسی و کیبورد، جلوه‌های بصری ذرات درخشان و افکت‌های صوتی سینتی‌سایزر واقعی!
            </p>
        </section>

        <!-- GAME SELECTION CARDS GRID -->
        <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-6 flex-grow w-full">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
                
                <!-- Game Card 1: Neon Drift Overdrive -->
                <div class="glass-box rounded-2xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-between group relative overflow-hidden">
                    <div>
                        <div class="relative w-full h-36 rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-4 bg-cyber-dark border border-cyber-magenta/30 flex items-center justify-center">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-car-side text-5xl text-cyber-cyan group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300"></i>
                            <span class="absolute top-2 right-2 text-[10px] bg-cyan-400/20 border border-cyan-400 text-cyan-300 font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">مسابقه سه‌بعدی نئونی</span>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1 group-hover:text-cyber-cyan transition-colors">نئون دریفت (Neon Drift Overdrive)</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                            با ماشین اسپرت نئونی از ترافیک سبقت بگیر، کریستال‌های نیترو جمع کن و با دریفت و توربو رکورد بزن!
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-xs text-gray-400 mb-3 font-mono">
                            <span>رکورد شما:</span>
                            <span id="high-score-drive" class="text-cyber-cyan font-bold font-orbitron">0</span>
                        </div>
                        <button onclick="launchGame('drive')" class="w-full cyber-btn border-cyber-cyan text-cyber-cyan hover:bg-cyber-cyan py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i> اجرای بازی
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Game Card 2: Space Laser Shooter -->
                <div class="glass-box rounded-2xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-between group relative overflow-hidden">
                    <div>
                        <div class="relative w-full h-36 rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-4 bg-cyber-dark border border-purple-500/30 flex items-center justify-center">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-shuttle-space text-5xl text-cyber-purple group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300"></i>
                            <span class="absolute top-2 right-2 text-[10px] bg-cyber-purple/20 border border-cyber-purple text-cyber-purple font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">شلیک دوگانه اتومات</span>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1 group-hover:text-cyber-purple transition-colors">مدافع لیزری (Laser Shooter)</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                            تیراندازی اتوماتیک لیزری دوگانه، دشمنان فضایی هوشمند و پاداش‌های قدرت و انفجارهای ذرات!
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-xs text-gray-400 mb-3 font-mono">
                            <span>رکورد شما:</span>
                            <span id="high-score-space" class="text-cyber-purple font-bold font-orbitron">0</span>
                        </div>
                        <button onclick="launchGame('space')" class="w-full cyber-btn border-cyber-purple text-cyber-purple hover:bg-cyber-purple py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i> اجرای بازی
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Game Card 3: Cyber Memory -->
                <div class="glass-box rounded-2xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-between group relative overflow-hidden">
                    <div>
                        <div class="relative w-full h-36 rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-4 bg-cyber-dark border border-lime-500/30 flex items-center justify-center">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-brain text-5xl text-cyber-lime group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300"></i>
                            <span class="absolute top-2 right-2 text-[10px] bg-cyber-lime/20 border border-cyber-lime text-cyber-lime font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">پیش‌نمایش ۵ ثانیه‌ای</span>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1 group-hover:text-cyber-lime transition-colors">حافظه سایبری (Cyber Memory)</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                            در ۵ ثانیه اول تمام کارت‌های نئونی سه بعدی باز می‌شوند تا جایگاه کارت‌ها را به خاطر بسپارید!
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-xs text-gray-400 mb-3 font-mono">
                            <span>رکورد شما:</span>
                            <span id="high-score-memory" class="text-cyber-lime font-bold font-orbitron">0</span>
                        </div>
                        <button onclick="launchGame('memory')" class="w-full cyber-btn border-cyber-lime text-cyber-lime hover:bg-cyber-lime py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i> اجرای بازی
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Game Card 4: Cyber Pong Brick Breaker -->
                <div class="glass-box rounded-2xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-between group relative overflow-hidden">
                    <div>
                        <div class="relative w-full h-36 rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-4 bg-cyber-dark border border-cyan-500/30 flex items-center justify-center">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-table-tennis-paddle-ball text-5xl text-cyber-cyan group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300"></i>
                            <span class="absolute top-2 right-2 text-[10px] bg-cyber-cyan/20 border border-cyber-cyan text-cyber-cyan font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">دژ پینگ‌پنگ نئونی</span>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1 group-hover:text-cyber-cyan transition-colors">دژ سایبری (Cyber Pong)</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                            بازی فوق‌العاده جذاب پین‌بال/بریک‌بریکر! آجرهای نئونی را با توپ لیزری پرسرعت متلاشی کنید.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-xs text-gray-400 mb-3 font-mono">
                            <span>رکورد شما:</span>
                            <span id="high-score-pong" class="text-cyber-cyan font-bold font-orbitron">0</span>
                        </div>
                        <button onclick="launchGame('pong')" class="w-full cyber-btn border-cyber-cyan text-cyber-cyan hover:bg-cyber-cyan py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i> اجرای بازی
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>


                <!-- Added Game 5: Neon Dodge -->
                <div class="glass-box rounded-2xl p-5 flex flex-col justify-between group relative overflow-hidden">
                    <div>
                        <div class="relative w-full h-36 rounded-xl overflow-hidden mb-4 bg-cyber-dark border border-yellow-500/30 flex items-center justify-center">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-meteor text-5xl text-yellow-400 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"></i>
                            <span class="absolute top-2 right-2 text-[10px] bg-yellow-400/20 border border-yellow-400 text-yellow-300 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">جا خالی بده!</span>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white mb-1">فرار نئونی (Neon Dodge)</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">از شهاب‌سنگ‌ها فرار کن و تا می‌توانی زنده بمان!</p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-xs text-gray-400 mb-3"><span>رکورد شما:</span><span id="high-score-dodge" class="text-yellow-300 font-bold">0</span></div>
                        <button onclick="launchGame('dodge')" class="w-full cyber-btn py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs"><i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i> اجرای بازی</button>
                    </div>
